                            <comment id="15354709" author="vsisko" created="Wed, 29 Jun 2016 07:08:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Implemented convertation of Oracle specific TIMESTAMP to java.sql.Timestamp. ignite-3394&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15365755" author="kuaw26" created="Thu, 7 Jul 2016 07:43:02 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Vasiliy, please rework fix as discussed here: &lt;a href=&quot;http://apache-ignite-developers.2346864.n4.nabble.com/Custom-transformer-for-CacheJdbcPojoStore-td9664.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://apache-ignite-developers.2346864.n4.nabble.com/Custom-transformer-for-CacheJdbcPojoStore-td9664.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Introduce JdbcTypesTransformer class and move all logic there.&lt;br/&gt;
And use this class as default if user does not specify custom transformer.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See JdbcTypeHasher usage as example.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15374577" author="vsisko" created="Wed, 13 Jul 2016 08:13:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;In JDBC store a separated data mapper has been added. &lt;br/&gt;
Default implementation of mapper include solution for currently known issues.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15376236" author="anovikov" created="Thu, 14 Jul 2016 03:06:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Reviewed.&lt;br/&gt;
data mapper -&amp;gt; types transformer.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Pavel, please test.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15378987" author="pkonstantinov" created="Fri, 15 Jul 2016 07:58:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Ilya,  could you please build staging from the branch ignite-3394. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15378992" author="ustas" created="Fri, 15 Jul 2016 08:02:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Ok&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15379159" author="pkonstantinov" created="Fri, 15 Jul 2016 10:05:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Successfully tested in branch as described in description&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15383570" author="anovikov" created="Tue, 19 Jul 2016 04:32:33 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Reviewed. Merged.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
